use the Church of Caine as a story idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-06T10:34:04-08:00","id":1556247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1555972-the-crimson-gutter?p=1556001#post1556001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The idea that V5 presents the Anarchs and Camarilla as coexisting with any consistency is an interesting take.</div> </div> </div> </div>Its one of the mistakes of 5th that the anarchs arnt engaged in total war with the tower since it nueters the central political conflict for a slightly more standoffish rendition of revised were the carmarilla keeps on being the dinner party from hell and the anarchs keep it real on the street.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 12-06-2025, 01:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-06T10:54:02-08:00","id":1556250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1555972-the-crimson-gutter?p=1556247#post1556247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Its one of the mistakes of 5th that the anarchs arnt engaged in total war with the tower since it nueters the central political conflict for a slightly more standoffish rendition of revised were the carmarilla keeps on being the dinner party from hell and the anarchs keep it real on the street.</div> </div> </div> </div>For me I find the mistake more that it doesn't want to commit to one depiction or another in this frustratingly inconsistent way. There's war over here, there's not over there. There's waves of pending assassination and violence over here, there's not over there. Cities are monosect over here, they're not over there. Annnd so forth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-06T11:15:28-08:00","id":1556257,"title":"","content":"Ha ha, you almost got me again, board turning my post to spam because I wanted to add another sentence in, but not today, Satan!<br /> <br /> I wanted to otherwise add:<br /> <br /> It doesn't even come off as &quot;well we want there to be a varied state of affairs&quot; as far as the depiction of these things, it just feels like a mess that doesn't fit together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-07T08:01:36-08:00","id":1556296,"title":"","content":"I think the &quot;total war&quot; versus &quot;Cold War&quot; interpretation of the sects was just a mistake by V5 writers as total war doesn't work in vampire with the setting.<br /> <br /> I don't even mean just with the Anarchs but the Sabbat and Second Inquisition too.<br /> <br /> The massive conflicts either have to end or destroy the premise for the Masquerade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-07T13:58:06-08:00","id":1556311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1555972-the-crimson-gutter?p=1556296#post1556296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the &quot;total war&quot; versus &quot;Cold War&quot; interpretation of the sects was just a mistake by V5 writers as total war doesn't work in vampire with the setting.<br /> <br /> I don't even mean just with the Anarchs but the Sabbat and Second Inquisition too.<br /> <br /> The massive conflicts either have to end or destroy the premise for the Masquerade.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats a pretty subjective take. The writters only decide how robust the masquarade is.<br /> <br /> I wouldnt even call v5's outlook a cold war. More a underwelming pissing contest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}